# i18n machine translation (Farm Dashboard)

When running `npm run i18n:fill` or updating locale JSON files:

- Google Cloud Translation credentials live in **`FS25_FarmDashboard_App/web/locales/.mt-env.local`** (gitignored). Read that file for `GOOGLE_TRANSLATE_API_KEY`; do not paste keys into chat, commits, or rules.
- After fill: `npm run i18n:build` then `npm run i18n:verify`.
- If fill returns **403 accessNotConfigured**, the GCP project must enable [Cloud Translation API](https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/translate.googleapis.com) and allow the API key to call `translate.googleapis.com`.
